<title>USA: Burlington Northern to issue century bond.</title>
<headline>Burlington Northern to issue century bond.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Northern Santa Fe Corp is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $200 million century bond offering, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The 100-year deal is expected to be underwritten by Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, dealers said.</p>
<p>Unofficial price talk was seen at 85-87 basis points over U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
